                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='7782' id='282' type-v2='text' w='83294' x='640' y='91418'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' underline='true'>How to read the tree map: </run>
                    <run>
- Squares are grouped by L0, L1 and L2 categories, so for example for May 2022, Impulse L0 category is grouped by 7 categories/squares (3 for snacks and 4 for beverages).
- The size of the square is given by the total number of orders made by L2 Category on the selected Month. 
- The color of the square depends on the increase (green) or decrease (red) of orders compared with the last month </run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone h='75809' id='101' name='Tree Map Monthly Behaviour' synchronized='1' type-v2='currpage' w='15426' x='83934' y='23391'>
                  <zone-style>
