    <dashboard name='KPI Definitions'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/AssortmentPerformance_16445069000060/KPIDefinitions?rev=' id='KPIDefinitions' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/AssortmentPerformanceDeepDive_16581531678340' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='1000' maxwidth='1000' minheight='1000' minwidth='1000' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98400' id='3' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='800'>
            <zone fixed-size='95' h='10300' id='5' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='800'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='14'>KPI Definitions</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='69800' id='6' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='11100'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>*Turkey Data is not reliable before May 2022</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Average Number of Listed SKUs per Warehouse</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>: Sum of daily number of listed SKUs per  warehouse / Number of warehouse-day</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Average Number of Listed SKUs</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>: Average Number of listed SKUs per country</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>GPV</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>: (Gross Purchase Value) : Average price paid by customers excluding vouchers and delivery fee per warehouse-day</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>ABV</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'> (Average Basket Value) :  Total GPV / Number of orders</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>ABS</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'> (Average Basket Size) :  Total items sold / Number of orders</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Frequency</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>: Number of Orders / Number of Unique Customers</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Efficiency</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'><![CDATA[: 1 - (Number of listed SKUs older than 90 days with average unit sold < 1 per warehouse-week / Number of listed SKUs older than 90 days)]]></run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Newness:  </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'><![CDATA[Number of SKUs < 90 days old / Number of listed SKUs]]></run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Avg. L3 Categories</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>: The average of the number of listed Level 3 Categories per country</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Avg. Coverage L3 Categories</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>: The average number of  listed Level 3 Categories / total number Level 3 Categories per country</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>ASP per Cat (Average Sales Price per Category): </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>Total GPV of an specific category / orders that included the specific category </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Æ </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>AQS per Cat (Average Quantity Size per Category): </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>Total items sold of an specific category / orders that included the specific category</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Category Frequency: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>Number of Orders of an specific category / Number of Unique Customers that ordered to the specific category</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Basket Penetration: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>Orders of an specific category / total orders made by country and month</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Customer Penetration: Unique </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>Customers of an specific category / total Unique Customers by country and month</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Avg L1 Cats Present: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>Average of L1 Categories that were included on orders of an specific category (works correctly just when you are evaluating L1 depth). </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>*Please take into account following statements to avoid confussion or mistaken calculations for Category related Dashboards:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>1. Metrics such ABV, ABS or Frequency are isolated meaning that for iexample for ABV, Total GPV of only an specific category is taken divided by the total orders of this specific category. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>2. If you sum KPIs such Total Orders per category you will NOT come to the total orders of a country/region, because you will be duplicating data </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>3. Avg L1 Cat metric is correct from an L1 Level View</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>4. Total Avg Listed SKUs are the same for L0, L1, and L2 contrywise. However, if you start to add countries or regions, L0, L1 and L2 avg. listed SKUs may differ a littlebit, since there are categories that are not present on all countries. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
